Description: Retry memcache operations after a disconnected server
 libmemcached closes the failed socket when an operation returns a connection
 failure, but Shibboleth immediately propagates the error. Clone the client to
 discard connection and DNS state, then retry up to three times with short,
 deterministic backoff.
Author: Rackspace Technology
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-10-05
Comment: libmemcached 1.1.4 can leak a partial clone if its internal allocation fails.
